flowchart LR
  U[User / Mandate] --> IC[Intent Capture]
  IC --> N[Normalizer + UUID]
  N --> P[Planner Router]
  P --> R[Rules]
  P --> L[Local Model]
  P -. online only .-> O[Responses API]
  R --> TC[Tool Contract Engine]
  L --> TC
  O --> TC
  W[WebMCP Registry] --> A[WebMCP Adapter]
  A --> TC
  TC -->|ALLOW| E[WebMCP Executor]
  TC -->|HUMAN| H[Human Gate]
  TC -->|RECONCILE| V[Evidence / Reconcile]
  E --> V
  V --> F[EFSM]
  F --> C[Commit]
  F --> Q[Offline Queue]
  C --> AL[Signed Audit Log]
  Q --> S[Sync Server]
  S --> AL
